  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per-A 101.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to provide standards of practice and procedure for proceedings conducted by the personnel appeals board.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Per-A 100) #7377, eff 10-23-00; ss by #9203, eff 10-23-08",
